noPhotos

# D_0*+ l nu (ISGW2), as the LHCb D** cocktail
# LHCb-style cocktail component (DecFiles Sim10 11874430/12873450, 11676012/12675402), e/mu 50/50

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B0sig  anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.5  D_0*+  e-  anti-nu_e   ISGW2;
0.5  D_0*+  mu-  anti-nu_mu  ISGW2;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay D_0*+
1.0  D0  pi+   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay D_0*-

End
